briefing =
    Commander Turki Al-Zahrani. While this platform jams, no one can see the Directorate hub. Its four jammer generators sit under an Iron Curtain prototype: nothing can touch them while the curtain control room runs it.
    
    Your boarding team lands on the south pad with Tanya, two engineers and no reinforcements. Clear the control deck, take the control room with an engineer to drop the curtain, then let Tanya place charges on every generator out on the wings. When the jamming stops, Orion will come from the docks and the sea: hold the control room until the picture comes back. The two deck scanners take turns; the lane down the middle is out of their sight.
    
    If Tanya falls, the control room is destroyed, or both engineers are lost before it is taken, the operation fails.
